1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:03,000
Good morning, SpongeBob!
早上好，海绵宝宝！

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:03,900
Morning, Patrick!
早上好，派大星！

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,800
You here for your pre-lunch Krabby Patty?
你是来吃午饭前的开胃蟹黄堡吗？

4
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,700
I'm getting two today.
我今天要两个。

5
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,900
One for me and one for my friend.
一个给我，一个给我朋友。

6
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,000
Oh, have I met this friend?
哦，我见过这位朋友吗？

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,900
You know me, SpongeBob.
你认识我啊，海绵宝宝。

8
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,300
Enjoy, Patrick's tummy.
好好享用吧，派大星的肚子。

9
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,500
Thirteen, fourteen, fifteen...
十三、十四、十五……

10
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,800
Hey, Mr. Krabs, I thought we got our tartar sauce delivery on Thursday.
嘿，蟹老板，我记得塔塔酱是周四送货吧？

11
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,900
Tartar...
塔塔……

12
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,100
Sauce?
……酱？

13
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,400
Bull's-eye!
正中靶心！

14
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:45,600
Plankton!
痞老板！

15
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,900
So it's a food fight he wants, eh?
这么说他是想打一场食物仗，是吧？

16
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,900
Welcome to Air Plankton.
欢迎乘坐“痞老板航空”。

17
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:55,600
Please put your seat backs and tray tables up as we're now approaching our final destination.
请收起座椅靠背和小桌板，我们即将抵达最终目的地。

18
00:00:56,400 --> 00:01:01,600
Okay, Patrick, load the potatoes!
好了派大星，装土豆！

19
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,000
Mashed or scalloped, sir?
要土豆泥还是土豆片，长官？

20
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:05,700
No, Patrick. Raw.
不，派大星。生的。

21
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:06,900
Yes, sir!
是，长官！

22
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:09,400
Locked and loaded!
装填完毕！

23
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:15,200
Don't worry, little formula, you'll be safe in this, uh, safe.
别担心，小配方，你在这个……呃……保险箱里很安全。

24
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,200
Fire!
开火！

25
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:23,100
Potatoes?
土豆？

26
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,200
He's closing in!
他逼近了！

27
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,600
I think we have a few minutes before he gets here.
我看还有几分钟他才会到。

28
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:32,700
He's right on top of us!
他已经到头顶了！

29
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,600
Hey, it's raining fries!
嘿，下薯条了！

30
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:43,600
It's gonna take a lot more than potatoes to bring this baby down!
这点土豆可打不下我这架宝贝飞机！

31
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,800
Or maybe not.
呃……好像也不一定。

32
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:56,800
Wait a minute, Patrick. Look! He's got a tank!
等等，派大星，你看！他有坦克！

33
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:05,800
Well, Krabs, you're certainly in a pickle now!
怎么样蟹老板，你现在可真是“泡”在酸黄瓜里了！

34
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:18,900
Hey, it's raining pickles!
嘿，下酸黄瓜了！

35
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Now it's raining...
现在下的是……

36
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:24,200
Tanks.
……坦克。

37
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,700
You're welcome!
不用谢！

38
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,500
Finland.
芬兰。

39
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:36,600
Your order, sir!
您的订单，长官！

40
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:41,600
I'll have two Krabby Patties—extra ketchup, extra mustard, and hold the mayo.
我要两个蟹黄堡——多加番茄酱、多加芥末，不要蛋黄酱。

41
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,800
Wrong channel!
打错频道了！

42
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:44,500
Your order, sir!
您的订单，长官！

43
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:47,800
Extra ketchup! Extra mustard! Hold the mayo!
多加番茄酱！多加芥末！不要蛋黄酱！

44
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,400
Yes, sir!
是，长官！

45
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:52,300
Extra ketchup! Extra mustard!
多加番茄酱！多加芥末！

46
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,900
Hold the mayo!
抱住蛋黄酱！

47
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:58,300
Unleash the condiments!
释放调料！

48
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,000
With relish!
再加点调味酱！

49
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,700
Excuse me!
不好意思！

50
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:20,600
Hello? Hello?
喂？喂？

51
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,600
Guess y'all don't want my money.
看来你们不想要我的钱啊。

52
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:23,200
Money?
钱？

53
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,600
Thank you! Come again!
谢谢！欢迎再来！

54
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:34,100
I can't hold the mayo any longer!
我快抱不住这罐蛋黄酱了！

55
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:43,200
Mayo? Well, it's going to take a lot more than mayo to stop—
蛋黄酱？哼，这点蛋黄酱可拦不住——

56
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:49,000
Now what?
现在怎么办？

57
00:03:50,100 --> 00:04:03,600
Uhh... I just remembered! I don't work for Mr. Krabs.
呃……我想起来了！我不给蟹老板打工了。

58
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:10,200
Robot! Robot! ROBOT! GIANT ROBOT! Robot! Robot!
机器人！机器人！机器人！巨型机器人！机器人！机器人！

59
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:14,200
Mr. Krabs! Plankton's here and he's got a giant robot!
蟹老板！痞老板来了，他还有个巨型机器人！

60
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,800
Quick, boy! Bar the door!
快，孩子！把门堵上！

61
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:17,300
Got it!
堵好了！

62
00:04:27,300 --> 00:04:31,400
I'll take one secret formula... to go.
我要一份秘方……打包带走。

63
00:04:43,500 --> 00:04:45,500
Oh, barnacles! I'm out of gas?
哦，糟了！我没油了？

64
00:04:48,100 --> 00:04:50,000
Well, I'm not through yet.
我还没完呢。

65
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:53,400
I've got something that will make you hand over that formula.
我有样东西能让你乖乖交出配方。

66
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,200
Something you can't resist.
一样你无法抗拒的东西。

67
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,600
Money!
钱！

68
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,800
Yes.
没错。

69
00:05:01,100 --> 00:05:03,800
That's... that's... that's impossible!
这……这……这不可能！

70
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:07,600
Well, it was full of money just last week.
呃，上周里面还装满了钱呢。

71
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:11,200
And then I bought that airplane and built that tank—
然后我买了那架飞机，还造了那辆坦克——

72
00:05:11,300 --> 00:05:16,400
Sounds to me like someone's just a wee bit... broke!
听起来某人只是有点……破产了！

73
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:19,800
Well, Krabs, I guess you've won.
好吧，蟹老板，我猜你赢了。

